  "title": "Digital Friends Animiniz Blindbox",
  "handle": "digital-friends-animiniz-blindbox",
  "description": "<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Note: This product is on pre-order and is expected to begin shipping in mid-December.</strong></span></h2>\n<p>“YOU HAD YOUR NINE EPISODES  AND FOUR ANIMINIZ LINES. NOW IT’S THEIR TIME TO SHINE!”<br>- Glitch Character Advocate</p>\n<p><strong>How it works:</strong><br>Each single box contains a figure of a random character, with a chance of finding the rare (or better) character.</p>\n<p>Each Common has a 1/8 chance of appearing, the Rare figure has a 1/12 chance of appearing, and the Super Rare figure has a 1/48 chance.</p>\n<p>The set pack contains 8 boxes with no double-ups and a guaranteed rare OR super rare figure if bought online. In the event a set pack contains both a rare AND a super rare, one of the common rarity figures will be replaced.</p>\n<p><strong>Featuring:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gummigoo</li>\n<li>Ghostly</li>\n<li>Ugly Fish</li>\n<li>Princess Loolilalu</li>\n<li>Angel</li>\n<li>Disappearing Guy</li>\n<li>Ming</li>\n<li>Rare: Gloink Queen</li>\n<li>Super Rare: ???</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Product design by <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Courtney Brenek @courtneybrenek, Rosie de Bruin @PuffcakeRosie, Lukasz Borges, Gwyn ‘Moumekie’ van Hameren @moumekie, Jurre de Groot, Gijs Van Kooten @revvels, Nichil Nowrungsah, Tom Keijer, Astrovision Studios, Angelica Zhang<br>Packaging Design by Courtney Brenek and Rizz Idini</p>",
